  "question": {
    "html": "<p>During an experiment a monatomic ideal gas is subjected to an adiabatic compression, transitioning from initial state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> to a final state with volume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>. The work done on the gas during the process is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>. What is the work done on the gas and the change in the internal energy of the gas during an isothermal compression from initial state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> to a final state with volume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Work done</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Change in internal energy</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Less than zero</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Greater than zero</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Zero</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Zero</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
